[00:01.34]1. O Jehovah, God of goodness,
[00:14.68]You have blessed us all our days!
[00:20.68]You are holy, ever loyal,
[00:26.68]And so good in all your ways.
[00:33.16]You show favor, granting mercy,
[00:39.16]Far beyond what we deserve.
[00:45.16]You’re so worthy of our worship,
[00:58.36]And it’s you we gladly serve.
[01:01.91]2. Your own goodness is reflected
[01:05.46]In the people whom you choose;
[01:09.01]And the proof is in their conduct
[01:12.56]And the preaching of good news.
[01:16.60]Your good teaching, your good shepherds,
[01:21.20]Bear good fruit in many lands.
[01:25.76]May you grant us holy spirit,
[01:30.48]And may goodness guide our hands.
[01:44.54]3. May you bless our deeds of goodness
[01:48.94]To our brothers, great or small.
[01:53.56]May we show them special favor
[01:58.12]As we work at good t’ward all.
[02:02.48]In each fam’ly, congregation,
[02:07.44]In each town and neighborhood,
[02:11.80]With your blessing and your spirit,
[02:16.52]May we be a force for good.